message: "If you use this benchmark, architecture, or codebase in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "F3-Swarm v1.5: Verifier-Guided Heterogeneous Edge-Swarm Inference, Distributed RAM Pooling, and Residual Code Repair for Frugal Agentic Intelligence"
abstract: "Polybee F3-Swarm is an enterprise-grade 3-tier heterogeneous language model swarm orchestrating edge and local models (Qwen2.5-0.5B, 1.5B, and Coder-3B) with calibrated uncertainty, micro-chain-of-thought with deterministic suffix closure, distributed RAM pooling, and Rashomon leave-one-out code repair, achieving 96.7% SOTA accuracy across 30 Brazilian Portuguese enterprise tasks under strict < 1.5 GiB active edge RAM."
